      "dc:source": "australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Australian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission\nAct 1964.\n*Act No. 41, 1956, as amended by No. 87, 1962.\n\n1964.\nAustralian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission.\nN o . 88.\n(2.) The Australian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission\nAct\n1956—\n1962* is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act.\n(3.) The Principal Act, as amended by this Act, may be cited\nas the Australian\nCoastal Shipping\nCommission\nAct\n1956-1964.\nCommencement.\n2 . This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it\nreceives the Royal Assent.\nTerms and\nconditions of\nemployment.",
      "skos:definition": "(1.) This Act may be cited as the Australian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission\nAct 1964.\n*Act No. 41, 1956, as amended by No. 87, 1962.\n\n1964.\nAustralian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission.\nN o . 88.\n(2.) The Australian\nCoastal\nShipping\nCommission\nAct\n1956—\n1962* is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act.\n(3.) The Principal Act, as amended by this Act, may be cited\nas the Australian\nCoastal Shipping\nCommission\nAct\n1956-1964.\nCommencement.\n2 . This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it\nreceives the Royal Assent.\nTerms and\nconditions of\nemployment.",
