      "dc:source": "australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "Section twenty-two of the Principal Act is amended by\nomitting from sub-section (2.) the words \" T w o thousand five\nh u n d r e d \"\nand\ninserting\nin\ntheir\nstead the words\n\" T h r e e\nthousand five h u n d r e d \" .",
      "skos:definition": "Section twenty-two of the Principal Act is amended by\nomitting from sub-section (2.) the words \" T w o thousand five\nh u n d r e d \"\nand\ninserting\nin\ntheir\nstead the words\n\" T h r e e\nthousand five h u n d r e d \" .",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "888a290f5a7401d3c7f01162e04775140b2f6427151b6a09d4018bdb15f653fc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964#sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
