    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964-sec-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 Section 5",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964#sec-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964.pdf, p.3",
      "values:originalText": "Section thirty-two of the Principal Act is amended\nby\nomitting sub-section (2.) and inserting in its stead the following\nsub-section:—\n\" ( 2 . ) Moneys of the Commission not immediately required\nfor the purposes of the Commission may be invested—\n(a) on fixed deposit with an approved bank;\n(b) in securities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n(c) subject to such conditions, if any, as the Treasurer determines by instrument under his hand—by way of loan\nto a person for the time being approved by the\nTreasurer\nupon\nthe\nsecurity\nof securities\nof\nthe\nCommonwealth.\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section thirty-two of the Principal Act is amended\nby\nomitting sub-section (2.) and inserting in its stead the following\nsub-section:—\n\" ( 2 . ) Moneys of the Commission not immediately required\nfor the purposes of the Commission may be invested—\n(a) on fixed deposit with an approved bank;\n(b) in securities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n(c) subject to such conditions, if any, as the Treasurer determines by instrument under his hand—by way of loan\nto a person for the time being approved by the\nTreasurer\nupon\nthe\nsecurity\nof securities\nof\nthe\nCommonwealth.\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964-sec-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cdee4c5328e3905a8c79e8429beb44b273cfd891ace7db06a760cfb42bfc6ff8"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-coastal-shipping-commission-act-1964#sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Section 5",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 3,
      "values:originalText": "Section thirty-two of the Principal Act is amended\nby\nomitting sub-section (2.) and inserting in its stead the following\nsub-section:—\n\" ( 2 . ) Moneys of the Commission not immediately required\nfor the purposes of the Commission may be invested—\n(a) on fixed deposit with an approved bank;\n(b) in securities of the Commonwealth;\nor\n(c) subject to such conditions, if any, as the Treasurer determines by instrument under his hand—by way of loan\nto a person for the time being approved by the\nTreasurer\nupon\nthe\nsecurity\nof securities\nof\nthe\nCommonwealth.\"."
    },
